@base = http://localhost:8001
@pricing = pricing:first-ratings-v1
@person = replace-with-a-returned-person-uuid

### Computed versions
GET {{base}}/api/talent/versions

### Three director cards
GET {{base}}/api/talent/{{pricing}}/profiles?role=director&genre=crime&limit=3

### Coverage and fee diagnostics
GET {{base}}/api/talent/{{pricing}}/report

### Full calculation evidence
GET {{base}}/api/talent/{{pricing}}/profiles/{{person}}/director?genre=crime
